WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:07.685
Dr. Odd stared at Wukong. "You're a monkey?"

2
00:00:07.686 --> 00:00:11.344
Roxy, Cozlin, and Wukong were back on Groon.

3
00:00:11.345 --> 00:00:14.188
Wukong puffed out his chest.

4
00:00:14.189 --> 00:00:19.584
"I'm not just a monkey—I'm Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!

5
00:00:19.585 --> 00:00:24.216
I once defeated Heaven's entire army!"

6
00:00:24.217 --> 00:00:27.971
"Fascinating," Dr. Odd said.

7
00:00:27.972 --> 00:00:31.861
"But can you make yourself tiny like Rocket Girl said?

8
00:00:31.862 --> 00:00:34.663
That's what we need you to do."

9
00:00:34.664 --> 00:00:38.155
"I do that all the time!" Wukong said.

10
00:00:38.156 --> 00:00:44.752
"Watch this!" He muttered a spell and became the size of a fly.

11
00:00:44.753 --> 00:00:48.591
He zipped into Dr. Odd's ear.

12
00:00:48.592 --> 00:00:51.710
"Hey! Get out of there!"

13
00:00:51.711 --> 00:00:56.033
Roxy and Cozlin giggled.

14
00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:59.562
"Funny, him!" Bippo said.

15
00:00:59.563 --> 00:01:03.451
Wukong flew back out and returned to his normal size.

16
00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:05.827
Dr. Odd frowned at him.

17
00:01:05.828 --> 00:01:08.056
Then he explained the mission.

18
00:01:08.057 --> 00:01:13.198
"You must go inside Meltron and destroy the controller."

19
00:01:13.199 --> 00:01:17.689
He described the controller. Wukong

20
00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:23.158
nodded. "I'm ready. Let's go!" Soon

21
00:01:23.159 --> 00:01:28.410
they were all walking toward the underground entrance. "That

22
00:01:28.411 --> 00:01:32.653
was a neat trick, Wukong," Cozlin said. "I

23
00:01:32.654 --> 00:01:37.213
can do cool stuff too—like walk through walls." Wukong

24
00:01:37.214 --> 00:01:42.639
shrugged. "I could probably do that." "How

25
00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:47.365
about this?" Cozlin held up her hand and shot a laser. Ka-boom!

26
00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:52.418
The hull of an old spaceship exploded. "Not

27
00:01:52.419 --> 00:01:56.980
bad." Wukong pulled out his iron bar. "This

28
00:01:56.981 --> 00:01:59.330
was a treasure from Heaven. I

29
00:01:59.331 --> 00:02:01.856
got it from a Dragon King." He

30
00:02:01.857 --> 00:02:06.105
swung it around. Bam!

31
00:02:06.106 --> 00:02:10.819
The bar hit Dr. Odd's leg. "Ouch!"

32
00:02:10.820 --> 00:02:15.602
Dr. Odd fell to the ground. Wukong

33
00:02:15.603 --> 00:02:21.394
bit his lip. He quickly put the iron bar away. Roxy

34
00:02:21.395 --> 00:02:28.563
glared at Wukong. "You need to learn how to be more careful!" Roxy

35
00:02:28.564 --> 00:02:35.166
carried Dr. Odd back to his moon as Cozlin and Wukong followed. Dr.

36
00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:39.846
Odd directed Roxy to a white room with medical equipment. "This

37
00:02:39.847 --> 00:02:43.781
is my hospital." A

38
00:02:43.782 --> 00:02:50.208
robot helped Dr. Odd onto a table and then scanned his leg. The

39
00:02:50.209 --> 00:02:56.963
robot sighed. "I'm afraid it's broken." ***

40
00:02:56.964 --> 00:03:00.391
Later everyone sat in Dr. Odd's computer room.

41
00:03:00.392 --> 00:03:04.132
His leg was in a cast.

42
00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:10.905
Wukong stared at the floor. "I'm really sorry."

43
00:03:10.906 --> 00:03:15.273
Dr. Odd shrugged. "I've made mistakes too.

44
00:03:15.274 --> 00:03:19.735
My medical robot said this should heal in a few weeks.

45
00:03:19.736 --> 00:03:22.522
It's not the end of the world."

46
00:03:22.523 --> 00:03:24.774
But Roxy was worried.

47
00:03:24.775 --> 00:03:28.686
"We need you to turn off that energy shield, Dr. Odd.

48
00:03:28.687 --> 00:03:32.411
Otherwise we can't stop Meltron!"

49
00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:36.080
"One of us can do it instead," Cozlin said.

50
00:03:36.081 --> 00:03:41.713
Roxy shook her head. "You and I have to fight the robots. Besides . . ." She

51
00:03:41.714 --> 00:03:44.421
shot a look at Wukong. "

52
00:03:44.422 --> 00:03:48.201
Somebody has a habit of causing trouble.

53
00:03:48.202 --> 00:03:53.102
We need to make sure he finds Meltron and gets the job done."

54
00:03:53.103 --> 00:03:55.497
Dr. Odd nodded.

55
00:03:55.498 --> 00:04:02.419
"I might know someone!" Cozlin hurried out of the room.

56
00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:07.574
"You really have changed, Dr. Odd," Roxy said.

57
00:04:07.575 --> 00:04:14.334
Dr. Odd chuckled. "I used to get angry at people all the time.

58
00:04:14.335 --> 00:04:19.745
But then you caught me, Mr. Presto, and Mrs. Wiggles and brought us to prison.

59
00:04:19.746 --> 00:04:23.975
I changed after reading a good self-help book there.

60
00:04:23.976 --> 00:04:29.725
It taught me to be a better person."

61
00:04:29.726 --> 00:04:32.857
Cozlin came back into the room, frowning.

62
00:04:32.858 --> 00:04:36.051
"I reached out to everyone I know.

63
00:04:36.052 --> 00:04:41.085
Meltron's robots have taken over even more planets now.

64
00:04:41.086 --> 00:04:47.572
Nobody can come to help us!"

